<title>AUSTRALIA: Defiance says mine test show nickel/copper.</title>
<headline>Defiance says mine test show nickel/copper.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Defiance Mining NL said on Thursday that testing had indicated significant nickel and copper sulphide intersections at its Carr Boyd mine propsect in Western Australia.</p>
<p>A drilling programme to further test distribution of the mineralisation is in progress, the company said.</p>
<p>Defiance shares were 2.5 cents higher at 24.5 cents at 3.50 p.m. (0550 GMT) on turnover of 14.7 million shares.  </p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
